{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"BIT-rclone-2026-116194","published":"2026-10-29T08:58:39.618Z","modified":"2026-10-29T10:55:48.033417719Z","aliases":["CVE-2026-116194","GHSA-hvpr-p4pv-4f46"],"summary":"Rclone 1.52.0 before 1.75.2 CSRF via pCloud OAuth Callback","details":"Rclone from 1.52.0 before 1.75.2 contains a cross-site request forgery vulnerability in the pCloud backend's localhost OAuth callback, which disables the state check and trusts the hostname parameter. Malicious web pages can send a stateless request to port 53682 during authorization, planting attacker tokens and API hosts so later transfers reach the attacker.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"rclone","ecosystem":"Bitnami","purl":"pkg:bitnami/rclone"},"ranges":[{"type":"SEMVER","events":[{"introduced":"1.52.0"},{"fixed":"1.75.2"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/bitnami/vulndb/tree/main/data/rclone/BIT-rclone-2026-116194.json"},"severity":[{"type":"CVSS_V4","score":"CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:H/AT:P/PR:N/UI:P/VC:H/VI:H/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N/E:X/CR:X/IR:X/AR:X/MAV:X/MAC:X/MAT:X/MPR:X/MUI:X/MVC:X/MVI:X/MVA:X/MSC:X/MSI:X/MSA:X/S:X/AU:X/R:X/V:X/RE:X/U:X"}]}],"references":[{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://github.com/rclone/rclone/security/advisories/GHSA-hvpr-p4pv-4f46"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-116194"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/rclone-1.52.0-before-1.75.2-csrf-via-pcloud-oauth-callback"}],"database_specific":{"cpes":["cpe:2.3:a:rclone:rclone:*:*:*:*:*:*:*:*"],"severity":"High"}}